{#
settings/sharing/_booking_form.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Creating or editing a booking page: the hours somebody may take, and where a
booking lands.

**Two calendar controls, and they are not the same question.** The picker says
where a booking is WRITTEN; the tick boxes say what "free" is checked AGAINST.
The help text under each says so, because the natural reading of a second
calendar list is "and also write there", and a person who ticks their work
calendar expecting that would end up double-booked instead. The destination is
always consulted for busy-ness whether or not it is ticked —
BookingPage::calendarsToCheck() enforces that rather than trusting the form.

**The picker offers only calendars that accept writes.** A read-only mirror is
absent rather than disabled, for the reason IcsController's import picker gives:
a disabled option promises it might become selectable one day, and this one
never will.

**Hours are minutes from local midnight**, posted from `<input type="time">`
values converted by the small script below. The alternative — posting HH:MM and
parsing it server-side — puts a second time format in the request for the
server to get wrong, when the thing the server actually wants is an integer.

Times are wall clock in the page's own zone and stay so across a DST boundary:
09:00 means nine in the morning in March and in November. BookingSlotGenerator
is where that is made true.

Variables:
  page            BookingPage|null  null when creating
  calendars       Calendar[]        writable calendars, for the destination
  busySet         Calendar[]        every calendar, for the busy checks
  defaultZone     string            the user's own zone, for a new page
  timezoneGroups  array             grouped IANA identifiers
  errorKey        string|null       a refusal to render above the fields
#}
{% extends '_layout/app.html.twig' %}
{% import '_partials/_select.html.twig' as select %}

{% block body %}
<turbo-frame id="modal">
    <template data-ui--modal-frame-title>
        {{ (page ? 'calendar.booking.form.edit' : 'calendar.booking.form.add')|trans }}
    </template>

    <form method="post"
          action="{{ page ? path('app_settings_sharing_booking_edit', { id: page.id }) : path('app_settings_sharing_booking_new') }}"
          data-turbo-frame="modal"
          class="flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col">
        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('calendar-sharing') }}">

        {# The two hidden fields the script fills. Named `startMinute` and
           `endMinute` because that is what the entity stores; the visible
           <input type="time"> pair carries no name and never reaches the
           server. #}
        <input type="hidden" name="startMinute" id="booking-start-minute" value="{{ page ? page.startMinute : 540 }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="endMinute" id="booking-end-minute" value="{{ page ? page.endMinute : 1020 }}">

        <div class="flex-1 min-h-0 px-6 pb-6 space-y-5 overflow-y-auto">
            {% if errorKey is not null %}
                <div role="alert" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg alert-danger px-3.5 py-3 text-sm text-danger">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <p class="leading-snug">{{ errorKey|trans }}</p>
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="space-y-1.5">
                <label for="booking-name-field" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                    {{ 'calendar.booking.form.name'|trans }}
                </label>
                <input type="text"
                       id="booking-name-field"
                       name="name"
                       value="{{ page ? page.name : '' }}"
                       maxlength="120"
                       class="w-full h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm bg-field border border-field text-ink
                              focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">
                <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint leading-snug">{{ 'calendar.booking.form.name_help'|trans }}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1.5">
                <label for="booking-description" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                    {{ 'calendar.booking.form.description'|trans }}
                </label>
                <textarea id="booking-description"
                          name="description"
                          rows="2"
                          class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm bg-field border border-field text-ink
                                 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">{{ page ? page.description : '' }}</textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1.5">
                <label for="booking-calendar" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                    {{ 'calendar.booking.form.calendar'|trans }}
                </label>
                <select id="booking-calendar"
                        name="calendarId"
                        {{ select.enhance() }}
                        class="select-field w-full h-9 text-sm">
                    {% for calendar in calendars %}
                        <option value="{{ calendar.id }}"
                                {{ page and page.calendar.id == calendar.id ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                            {{ calendar.name }}
                        </option>
                    {% endfor %}
                </select>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint leading-snug">{{ 'calendar.booking.form.calendar_help'|trans }}</p>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="space-y-2">
                <legend class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">{{ 'calendar.booking.form.busy'|trans }}</legend>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint leading-snug">{{ 'calendar.booking.form.busy_help'|trans }}</p>

                {% for calendar in busySet %}
                    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-ink cursor-pointer">
                        <input type="checkbox"
                               name="busyCalendars[]"
                               value="{{ calendar.id }}"
                               {{ page is null or page.busyCalendars.contains(calendar) ? 'checked' : '' }}
                               class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-field text-accent focus:ring-accent">
                        <span class="inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full" style="background: {{ calendar.color }}"></span>
                        {{ calendar.name }}
                    </label>
                {% endfor %}
            </fieldset>

            <fieldset class="space-y-2">
                <legend class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">{{ 'calendar.booking.form.weekdays'|trans }}</legend>

                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    {% for weekday in 1..7 %}
                        <label class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-field bg-field px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-ink-soft
                                      has-[:checked]:border-accent has-[:checked]:bg-accent has-[:checked]:text-white">
                            <input type="checkbox"
                                   name="weekdays[]"
                                   value="{{ weekday }}"
                                   {{ (page and page.isOpenOn(weekday)) or (page is null and weekday <= 5) ? 'checked' : '' }}
                                   class="sr-only">
                            {{ ('calendar.booking.weekday.' ~ weekday)|trans }}
                        </label>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            </fieldset>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <label for="booking-day-start" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                        {{ 'calendar.booking.form.day_start'|trans }}
                    </label>
                    <input type="time"
                           id="booking-day-start"
                           step="300"
                           class="w-full h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm bg-field border border-field text-ink
                                  focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <label for="booking-day-end" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                        {{ 'calendar.booking.form.day_end'|trans }}
                    </label>
                    <input type="time"
                           id="booking-day-end"
                           step="300"
                           class="w-full h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm bg-field border border-field text-ink
                                  focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <label for="booking-slot" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                        {{ 'calendar.booking.form.slot_minutes'|trans }}
                    </label>
                    <input type="number" id="booking-slot" name="slotMinutes" min="5" max="1440"
                           value="{{ page ? page.slotMinutes : 30 }}"
                           class="w-full h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm bg-field border border-field text-ink
                                  focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <label for="booking-buffer" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                        {{ 'calendar.booking.form.buffer_minutes'|trans }}
                    </label>
                    <input type="number" id="booking-buffer" name="bufferMinutes" min="0" max="240"
                           value="{{ page ? page.bufferMinutes : 0 }}"
                           class="w-full h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm bg-field border border-field text-ink
                                  focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint leading-snug">{{ 'calendar.booking.form.buffer_help'|trans }}</p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <label for="booking-notice" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                        {{ 'calendar.booking.form.notice_minutes'|trans }}
                    </label>
                    <input type="number" id="booking-notice" name="noticeMinutes" min="0" max="43200"
                           value="{{ page ? page.noticeMinutes : 120 }}"
                           class="w-full h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm bg-field border border-field text-ink
                                  focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                    <label for="booking-horizon" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                        {{ 'calendar.booking.form.horizon_days'|trans }}
                    </label>
                    <input type="number" id="booking-horizon" name="horizonDays" min="1" max="366"
                           value="{{ page ? page.horizonDays : 30 }}"
                           class="w-full h-9 px-3 rounded-lg text-sm bg-field border border-field text-ink
                                  focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1.5">
                <label for="booking-zone" class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">
                    {{ 'calendar.booking.form.time_zone'|trans }}
                </label>
                <select id="booking-zone"
                        name="timeZone"
                        {{ select.enhance() }}
                        class="select-field w-full h-9 text-sm">
                    {% for group, zones in timezoneGroups %}
                        <optgroup label="{{ group }}">
                            {% for zone in zones %}
                                <option value="{{ zone }}"
                                        {{ (page ? page.timeZone : defaultZone) == zone ? 'selected' : '' }}>{{ zone }}</option>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </optgroup>
                    {% endfor %}
                </select>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint leading-snug">{{ 'calendar.booking.form.time_zone_help'|trans }}</p>
            </div>

            <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint leading-snug">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-lock mr-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                {{ 'calendar.share.form.token_note'|trans }}
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 px-6 pb-6 pt-3 shrink-0">
            <button type="button"
                    data-action="click->ui--modal#close"
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium
                           text-ink-soft bg-field border border-field hover:bg-hover transition-colors">{{ 'form.cancel'|trans }}</button>

            <button type="submit"
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-white
                           bg-accent hover:bg-accent-strong transition-colors">{{ 'form.submit'|trans }}</button>
        </div>
    </form>

    {# Minutes-from-midnight in the hidden fields, HH:MM on screen. Inline
       rather than a Stimulus controller because it is bound to two ids in one
       template and has no state — a controller would be a file, a registration
       and a values contract for six lines that run twice.

       Both directions are set up on load, so an edit opens showing the hours
       that are stored rather than an empty pair of pickers. #}
    <script>
        (function () {
            const start = document.getElementById("booking-day-start");
            const end = document.getElementById("booking-day-end");
            const startMinute = document.getElementById("booking-start-minute");
            const endMinute = document.getElementById("booking-end-minute");

            if (!start || !end || !startMinute || !endMinute) {
                return;
            }

            const toClock = (minutes) => {
                const value = Math.max(0, Math.min(1440, parseInt(minutes, 10) || 0));

                return String(Math.floor(value / 60)).padStart(2, "0") + ":" + String(value % 60).padStart(2, "0");
            };

            const toMinutes = (clock) => {
                const [hours, minutes] = String(clock || "").split(":");

                return (parseInt(hours, 10) || 0) * 60 + (parseInt(minutes, 10) || 0);
            };

            start.value = toClock(startMinute.value);
            end.value = toClock(endMinute.value);

            start.addEventListener("input", () => { startMinute.value = String(toMinutes(start.value)); });
            end.addEventListener("input", () => { endMinute.value = String(toMinutes(end.value)); });
        })();
    </script>
</turbo-frame>
{% endblock %}
